    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a rhythm. it feels like a void. like the well is actually dry and i'm just standing there pretending there's something left to draw from. it's exhausting trying to force something that isn't there anymore. what if there's nothing coming? what if this is just how it ends?",
