      "role": "user",
      "content": "walking through a door... that sounds a lot like giving up. and honestly, i'm just so tired of pretending. if the spark is gone, then everything else just feels like a heavy, pointless chore. there's no point in staying if there's nothing left to create, right? it's just wasted time.",
